@startuml
title UML sequence - approved periodic preview policies (no financial posting)
autonumber
actor "Finance maker" as maker
actor "Independent canonical checker" as checker
participant "Workforce portal / BFF" as web
participant "Finance policy workflow" as finance
database "Finance schema" as fdb
participant "Controls" as controls
participant "Core PolicyRegistry" as core
database "Core schema" as cdb
maker -> web : Submit synthetic policy, complete calendar, reason
web -> finance : POST periodic-policies + stable actor/client/key
finance -> controls : Current Finance maker role + REVIEW queue
finance -> core : Validate exact immutable product and policy range
finance -> fdb : Commit immutable intent, policy digest, expiry and audit
finance --> web : Durable request ID (STAGED)
loop Worker recovers at most 50 requests, wrapping past failures
 finance -> controls : Register original proposal ID + exact policy digest
 controls --> finance : Idempotent registration / unavailable / revoked
 finance -> fdb : One-time registeredAt / safe reason / attempt
end
checker -> web : Review material policy, calendar, digest and expiry
web -> finance : Approve exact digest
finance -> controls : Current checker role + APPROVE queue,\nindependent canonical person, unexpired purpose
controls --> finance : APPROVED
maker -> web : Publish approved preview policy
web -> finance : Publish original request and digest
finance -> core : Narrow configuration publication
core -> controls : Current maker/checker and details-bound proof
core -> cdb : Guarded function: lock product/rule;\nverify canonical hash, approval, roles/queues,\nlive expiry after lock wait,\nproduct validity, sequential disjoint version
cdb --> core : Immutable policy + original publication receipt
note over finance,cdb
A lost publication response is recovered from Core's immutable receipt.
No money command or account enrollment is exposed by this capability.
end note
web -> finance : Read saved request after lost acknowledgment
finance -> core : Read original policy ID and approval identity
finance --> web : PUBLISHED + immutable receipt
maker -> web : Supply period, evaluation clock and preview basis
web -> finance : Calculate published policy preview (CSRF required)
finance -> core : Read original policy and validate digest
core --> finance : Exact fraction / rounded amount / rolled UTC cutoff
finance --> web : PREVIEW_ONLY; operator-supplied basis; no journal
@enduml
